<view class="page"><view class="title">让下一次养护有安排</view><view class="subtitle">{{vehicle.name}}</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{vehicle.archived}}">此车辆已归档；恢复车辆后可修改或删除计划。</view><view class="field" wx:if="{{presets.length}}"><view class="label">常用项目</view><view class="filters"><button wx:for="{{presets}}" wx:key="name" class="filter {{presetApplied && form.name === item.name ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="applyPreset">{{item.name}}</button></view><view class="tiny" wx:if="{{presetApplied}}">已填入常见周期，仅供参考，请以车辆手册为准。首次到期按今天和当前里程估算；车险、年检请选择实际到期日期。</view></view><view class="field" id="f-name"><view class="label">项目名称 *</view><input class="input {{errorField === 'name' ? 'invalid' : ''}}" value="{{form.name}}" maxlength="40" data-field="name" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：机油机滤、车险续期"/><view class="field-error" wx:if="{{errorField === 'name'}}">{{error}}</view></view><view class="switch-row"><text>设置到期日期</text><switch checked="{{dateEnabled}}" color="#065f46" bindchange="enableDate"/></view><view id="f-dueDate" wx:if="{{dateEnabled}}"><picker mode="date" value="{{pickerDate}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view class="picker {{errorField === 'dueDate' ? 'invalid' : ''}}">{{form.dueDate || '请选择到期日期'}} ▾</view></picker><view class="field-error" wx:if="{{errorField === 'dueDate'}}">{{error}}</view></view><view class="field" id="f-dueMileage"><view class="label">到期累计里程 · km（选填）</view><input class="input {{errorField === 'dueMileage' ? 'invalid' : ''}}" type="number" value="{{form.dueMileage}}" data-field="dueMileage" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：30000"/><view class="field-error" wx:if="{{errorField === 'dueMileage'}}">{{error}}</view></view><view class="notice">日期和里程至少填一项；同时填写时，任一条件先到即提醒。</view><view class="section-title spaced">完成后的重复周期</view><view class="grid"><view class="field" id="f-intervalMonths"><view class="label">每隔几个月</view><input class="input {{errorField === 'intervalMonths' ? 'invalid' : ''}}" type="number" value="{{form.intervalMonths}}" data-field="intervalMonths" bindinput="input" placeholder="不重复可留空"/><view class="field-error" wx:if="{{errorField === 'intervalMonths'}}">{{error}}</view></view><view class="field" id="f-intervalKm"><view class="label">每隔多少公里</view><input class="input {{errorField === 'intervalKm' ? 'invalid' : ''}}" type="number" value="{{form.intervalKm}}" data-field="intervalKm" bindinput="input" placeholder="不重复可留空"/><view class="field-error" wx:if="{{errorField === 'intervalKm'}}">{{error}}</view></view></view><view class="tiny">重复计划从最近一次实际完成日期 / 里程起算。修改周期会重算下次到期，修改首次到期值不影响已有完成记录。</view><view class="grid"><view class="field" id="f-leadDays"><view class="label">提前几天提醒</view><input class="input {{errorField === 'leadDays' ? 'invalid' : ''}}" type="number" value="{{form.leadDays}}" data-field="leadDays" bindinput="input" placeholder="默认 30"/><view class="field-error" wx:if="{{errorField === 'leadDays'}}">{{error}}</view></view><view class="field" id="f-leadKm"><view class="label">提前多少公里</view><input class="input {{errorField === 'leadKm' ? 'invalid' : ''}}" type="number" value="{{form.leadKm}}" data-field="leadKm" bindinput="input" placeholder="默认 500"/><view class="field-error" wx:if="{{errorField === 'leadKm'}}">{{error}}</view></view></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error && !errorField}}">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || !ready || vehicle.archived}}" bindtap="save">保存计划</button><button wx:if="{{form.id}}" class="danger spaced" disabled="{{vehicle.archived}}" bindtap="remove">删除计划</button><view class="footer-note">本版为站内提醒。周期请以车辆手册、实际到期日为准。</view></view>
